{"pageId":"/pages/docs/@slug","routeParams":{"*":"cli/init"},"data":{"doc":{"slug":"cli/init","title":"init","description":"","section":"CLI Reference","order":999,"filePath":"/home/runner/work/cli-forge/cli-forge/docs-site/docs/cli/init.md","content":"# init\n\n**Usage:** `cli-forge init <cliName>`\n\nGenerate a new CLI\n\n## Positional Arguments\n\n### cliName\n\n**Type:** string\n\nName of the CLI to generate.\n\n**Required**\n\n#### Aliases\n\n- cli-name\n\n## Flags\n\n### help\n\n**Type:** boolean\n\nShow help for the current command\n\n#### Aliases\n\n- h\n\n### version\n\n**Type:** boolean\n\nShow the version number for the CLI\n\n### output\n\n**Type:** string\n\nWhere should the CLI be created?\n\n#### Aliases\n\n- o\n\n### format\n\n**Type:** string\n\nWhat format should the CLI be in?\n\n**Default:** `\"ts\"`\n\n**Valid values:** `js`, `ts`\n\n### moduleType\n\n**Type:** string\n\nModule system for the generated project.\n\n**Default:** `\"esm\"`\n\n**Valid values:** `esm`, `cjs`\n\n### initialVersion\n\n**Type:** string\n\nInitial version used when creating the package.json for the new CLI.\n\n**Default:** `\"0.0.1\"`","renderedHtml":"<p><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>cli-forge init &#x3C;cliName></code></p>\n<p>Generate a new CLI</p>\n<h2 id=\"positional-arguments\">Positional Arguments<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#positional-arguments\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"cliname\">cliName<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#cliname\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> string</p>\n<p>Name of the CLI to generate.</p>\n<p><strong>Required</strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"aliases\">Aliases<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#aliases\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>cli-name</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"flags\">Flags<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#flags\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"help\">help<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#help\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> boolean</p>\n<p>Show help for the current command</p>\n<h4 id=\"aliases-1\">Aliases<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#aliases-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>h</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"version\">version<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#version\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> boolean</p>\n<p>Show the version number for the CLI</p>\n<h3 id=\"output\">output<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#output\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> string</p>\n<p>Where should the CLI be created?</p>\n<h4 id=\"aliases-2\">Aliases<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#aliases-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>o</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"format\">format<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#format\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> string</p>\n<p>What format should the CLI be in?</p>\n<p><strong>Default:</strong> <code>\"ts\"</code></p>\n<p><strong>Valid values:</strong> <code>js</code>, <code>ts</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"moduletype\">moduleType<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#moduletype\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> string</p>\n<p>Module system for the generated project.</p>\n<p><strong>Default:</strong> <code>\"esm\"</code></p>\n<p><strong>Valid values:</strong> <code>esm</code>, <code>cjs</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"initialversion\">initialVersion<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#initialversion\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> string</p>\n<p>Initial version used when creating the package.json for the new CLI.</p>\n<p><strong>Default:</strong> <code>\"0.0.1\"</code></p>","headings":[{"id":"positional-arguments","text":"Positional Arguments","level":2},{"id":"cliname","text":"cliName","level":3},{"id":"flags","text":"Flags","level":2},{"id":"help","text":"help","level":3},{"id":"version","text":"version","level":3},{"id":"output","text":"output","level":3},{"id":"format","text":"format","level":3},{"id":"moduletype","text":"moduleType","level":3},{"id":"initialversion","text":"initialVersion","level":3}]}}}